  "value": "word is a string of lowercase letters and skeletons a list of strings of the same length over lowercase letters and \"-\". A skeleton matches word when (1) at every non-dash position it equals word, and (2) all positions holding a dash cover the same letter of word (a skeleton without dashes matches only word itself). Return the matching skeletons in input order, keeping duplicates.",
